<title>USA: NYSE says seat sold for $1,475,000.</title>
<headline>NYSE says seat sold for $1,475,000.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said on Thursday that a seat on the exchange sold for $1,475,000, up $125,000 from the last seat sale on July 17.</p>
<p>The exchange said the current bid for a seat is $1.2 million, and the offer is $2 million.</p>
